r use of these services is governed by their\n               ",[3422,3436],[3441,3469],[3552,3568],[3573,3688],"                  <strong className=\"text-neutral-200\">Roblox:</strong> When you",[3707,3802],"log in or launch games, you are interacting directly with\n                  Roblox services. Please refer to{\" \"",[3804,3840],[3843,3863],[3981,4001],[4057,4077],[4103,4123],[4216,4234],[4236,4276],{"messageId":"153029","data":"153082","fix":"153083","desc":"153084"},{"messageId":"153029","data":"153085","fix":"153086","desc":"153087"},{"messageId":"153029","data":"153088","fix":"153089","desc":"153090"},{"messageId":"153029","data":"153091","fix":"153092","desc":"153093"},[4318,4336],[4341,4377],[4379,4411],[4417,4449],[4454,4725],"                  <strong className=\"text-neutral-200\">GitHub:</strong> We use\n                  GitHub's API to check for application updates. This may expose\n                  your IP address to GitHub when checking",{"messageId":"153029","data":"153094","fix":"153095","desc":"153084"},{"messageId":"153029","data":"153096","fix":"153097","desc":"153087"},{"messageId":"153029","data":"153098","fix":"153099","desc":"153090"},{"messageId":"153029","data":"153100","fix":"153101","desc":"153093"},[4739,4771],[4777,4809],[4814,4932],"                  <strong className=\"text-neutral-200\">Google Fonts:</strong> We",[4951,4968],"may load fonts from",[5027,5043],[5049,5077],[5083,5107],[5119,5143],[5175,5189],[5269,5297],[5337,5369],[5442,5456],[5461,5489],[5572,5588],[5593,5778],"                  <strong className=\"text-neutral-200\">Encryption:</strong>{\" \"}\n                  Sensitive account data may be encrypted at rest on your\n                 ",[5822,5854],[5860,5876],[5942,5970],[5976,5988],[6012,6036],[6068,6163],"              <h3 className=\"text-white font-semibold text-lg\">\n                4. Contact Us",[6178,6182],[6236,6388],"                If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or our\n      